^DD(.11,.42,21,14,0)="available for use by either the Classic FileMan lookup (^DIC), the Finder"
^DD(.11,.42,21,15,0)="(FIND^DIC or $$FIND1^DIC) or the Sort and Print (EN1^DIP)."
^DD(.11,.42,21,2,0)="alphabetically follows ""B"".  Calls to Classic FileMan lookup (^DIC) or the"
^DD(.11,.42,21,3,0)="Finder (FIND^DIC or $$FIND1^DIC) where the index is not specified will"
^DD(.11,.42,21,4,0)="include this index in the search. The index will be available for use by"
^DD(.11,.42,21,5,0)="the FileMan Sort and Print (EN1^DIP)."
^DD(.11,.42,21,6,0)=" "
^DD(.11,.42,21,7,0)="SORTING ONLY - The index name starts with ""A"". Calls to Classic FileMan"
